{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Mod Mage Mike",
    "steam_appid": 2946340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Mage Mike is a unique puzzle game where you program futuristic magic spells using a node editor. Your goal is to progress through the levels by hitting detectors put in tricky locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each node affects the magic projectiles with different properties\u2014speed, direction, delay, split, and more. By chaining them together, you can create almost unlimited variations in how a spell behaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logic puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program spell-shooting towers to aim at detectors. When hit, these detectors will light up, triggering events such as opening bridges or doors to progress through levels. It's definitely not always as straightforward as it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.poster.avif?t=1751644825\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.webm?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.mp4?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of many puzzles, you will also encounter The Evil Robots that will try to stop you reaching your goals. Fight back by programming attack towers or using strange weapons found throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.poster.avif?t=1751644825\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.webm?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.mp4?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a fully-featured level editor, allowing you to create your own magical, mystical adventures. Craft mind-teasing puzzles, orchestrate epic battles with powerful spells, or anything in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a spell laboratory for experimenting with spells, a campaign filled with levels ready to conquer, and the ability to freely share and download user-made levels.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mod Mage Mike is a unique puzzle game where you program futuristic magic spells using a node editor. Your goal is to progress through the levels by hitting detectors put in tricky locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each node affects the magic projectiles with different properties\u2014speed, direction, delay, split, and more. By chaining them together, you can create almost unlimited variations in how a spell behaves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logic puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program spell-shooting towers to aim at detectors. When hit, these detectors will light up, triggering events such as opening bridges or doors to progress through levels. It's definitely not always as straightforward as it sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.poster.avif?t=1751644825\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.webm?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/92636936a5efef3e1f8c0d906b0f6b50.mp4?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As part of many puzzles, you will also encounter The Evil Robots that will try to stop you reaching your goals. Fight back by programming attack towers or using strange weapons found throughout the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.poster.avif?t=1751644825\" width=480 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.webm?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946340/extras/5f75239d18c9d8f336bd562308f7f33c.mp4?t=1751644825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Level editor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a fully-featured level editor, allowing you to create your own magical, mystical adventures. Craft mind-teasing puzzles, orchestrate epic battles with powerful spells, or anything in-between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a spell laboratory for experimenting with spells, a campaign filled with levels ready to conquer, and the ability to freely share and download user-made levels.</p>",
    "short_description": "Mod Mage Mike is a unique puzzle game where you program futuristic magic spells using a node editor. Hit detectors placed in tricky locations, blast evil robots with custom-made spells, or use the built-in level editor to create and share your own imaginative levels.",
